---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — FinCalc India (DPDP Act 2023 Compliant)"
  description="FinCalc India privacy policy. 100% client-side computations, zero tracking, zero personal financial data collection in full compliance with India's DPDP Act 2023."
  keywords="privacy policy, DPDP Act 2023, data privacy, financial privacy, zero tracking"
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <main class="container-main py-12 sm:py-16 max-w-4xl">
    <nav class="breadcrumb mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">/</span>
      <span class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)] font-medium">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="glass-card-static p-6 sm:p-10 border border-[var(--color-border)] space-y-8">
      <div class="border-b border-[var(--color-border)] pb-6">
        <span class="category-badge badge-savings mb-3">Privacy & Security</span>
        <h1 class="font-[var(--font-heading)] font-bold text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-[var(--color-text-primary)] tracking-tight">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-2">
          Effective Date: <strong>September 2026</strong> · Fully Compliant with the <strong>Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act, India)</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs text-emerald-300 flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-xl">🛡️</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-sm block text-emerald-200 mb-1">Our Core Privacy Pledge: Zero Financial Telemetry</strong>
          FinCalc India was built with a fundamental architectural principle: <strong>Your financial numbers belong solely to you.</strong> We do not ask for your phone number, email address, PAN, Aadhaar, salary slips, or bank account details.
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-[var(--font-heading)] font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
          1. 100% Client-Side Computation Architecture
        </h2>
        <p>
          Every calculation performed on FinCalc India — whether computing an <strong>SBI Home Loan EMI</strong>, evaluating <strong>Old vs New Income Tax Regimes</strong>, running a <strong>Mutual Fund SIP compounding model</strong>, or checking <strong>PPF maturity</strong> — runs purely inside your browser's JavaScript virtual machine.
        </p>
        <p>
          None of your numeric input parameters or output reports are ever sent over network sockets to our servers or any third parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-[var(--font-heading)] font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
          2. Personal Data We Do NOT Collect
        </h2>
        <p>In accordance with Section 4 and Section 6 of the DPDP Act 2023, we confirm that we do NOT collect, store, or process:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs pl-2">
          <li><strong>Personally Identifiable Information (PII)</strong>: Names, phone numbers, email addresses, residential addresses.</li>
          <li><strong>Government Identifiers</strong>: Permanent Account Number (PAN), Aadhaar, Voter ID, Passport numbers.</li>
          <li><strong>Financial Records</strong>: Bank statements, CIBIL credit scores, credit card numbers, Demat account credentials.</li>
          <li><strong>Cross-Site Marketing Trackers</strong>: We do not employ fingerprinting trackers, advertising pixels, or data brokers.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-[var(--font-heading)] font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
          3. Browser Local Storage & Report Downloads
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you use the <strong>"Export to Excel"</strong> or <strong>"Download PDF (A4)"</strong> feature:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-xs pl-2">
          <li>Files are generated directly in memory inside your browser using client-side JavaScript Blobs.</li>
          <li>No server-side file generation or temporary cloud staging takes place.</li>
          <li>Once downloaded, the file resides exclusively on your local storage drive.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-[var(--font-heading)] font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
          4. Security Safeguards
        </h2>
        <p>
          FinCalc India deploys standard enterprise security controls:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-xs pl-2">
          <li><strong>HTTPS / TLS 1.3 Encryption</strong> across all assets.</li>
          <li><strong>Strict-Origin-When-Cross-Origin Referrer Policies</strong> to avoid leaking page navigation history.</li>
          <li><strong>Content-Type Options (nosniff)</strong> preventing MIME-sniffing exploits.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Third-Party Ad Script Injection</strong> ensuring clean and untampered script execution.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-[var(--font-heading)] font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
          5. Contact & Grievance Officer
        </h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules, 2021, and the DPDP Act 2023, if you have questions or inquiries regarding our data privacy architecture, you may contact our team at:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--color-border)] text-xs font-mono">
          <p>Privacy & Grievance Desk: privacy@fincalc.in</p>
          <p>Jurisdiction: New Delhi, India</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
